      en: ["Administrative center of Magwi County", "Home to the Acholi and Madi ethnic communities", "Major agricultural hub producing grain and vegetables", "Located in close proximity to the Ugandan border", "Set against the backdrop of the scenic Acholi Hills", "Key resettlement site for returning refugees since 2011"],
