      en: ["Located on the major highway between Juba and Yei.", "Agricultural hub in the country's fertile Green Belt.", "Known for its teak plantations and coffee cultivation.", "Historical center for education and teacher training.", "Home to the Pojulu ethnic community.", "Characterized by a humid tropical climate."],
      es: ["Población: aprox. 12.000 (2024)", "Superficie: aprox. 40 km²", "Altitud: 800 m s. n. m.", "Año de fundación: 1955", "Temperatura media: 24°C", "Distancia a la frontera congoleña: 20 km"],
      pt: ["População: aprox. 12.000 (2024)", "Superfície: aprox. 40 km²", "Altitude: 800 m acima do nível do mar", "Ano de fundação: 1955", "Temperatura média: 24°C", "Distância da fronteira congolesa: 20 km"],
      fr: ["Population : env. 12 000 (2024)", "Superficie : env. 40 km²", "Altitude : 800 m", "Année de fondation : 1955", "Température moyenne : 24°C", "Distance de la frontière congolaise : 20 km"],
